{"nodes": [{"id": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_technical_plan", "label": "AB-1001 Technical Plan", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Draft awaiting approval of D1 through D6. Inputs are the proposal, service-health and runtime-configuration specs, design, tasks, SDS sections 1 through 5, AGENTS.md, and the domain CLAUDE files. Implementation waits for a new instruction after opsx update."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_layout_signoff", "label": "D1 Layout Sign-off", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The chosen layout is backend and frontend. SDS section 1 and AGENTS.md section 2 say apps/api and apps/web, and SDS allows a different approved structure. Editing SDS and AGENTS needs approval, then proposal, design, and tasks paths are renamed."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_node_22", "label": "D2 Node 22 Engine", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": ".nvmrc is 22, engines.node is at least 22 and below 23, and engine-strict is true. The scanned local Node 26 would fail install, so Node 22 is required before implementation."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_shared_contracts", "label": "D3 HealthResponse and ErrorResponse", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shared ships ErrorResponse from SDS section 4 and HealthResponse so web and API prove the import path. fields items stay unknown arrays because OPEN-11 is unresolved. Both apps import only from @notes/shared, which depends on Zod and stays browser-safe."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_provisional_error_codes", "label": "D6 Provisional Error Codes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Unknown routes return the SDS error shape with provisional code NOT_FOUND. Unknown errors map to 500 INTERNAL_ERROR with a generic message. Both strings are provisional because the code catalogue is OPEN-11."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_dependency_approval", "label": "D5 Install-Time Dependency Approval", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exact versions are resolved at install and listed for approval before pnpm add and before the lockfile is committed. The plan invents no version numbers."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_create_app", "label": "createApp Without Env or Listen", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "createApp wires requestId, JSON parsing, routes, a 404, and the error handler, and it does not listen or read env. Tests never bind a port. The JSON body limit is deferred to AB-1004."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_error_handler", "label": "Central Error Handler", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Unknown errors become 500 INTERNAL_ERROR. Diagnostics, including the stack, are logged with requestId and never sent to the client. Malformed JSON is 400 and oversize bodies are 413. A small structured console logger avoids a new logging dependency."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_parse_env", "label": "Pure parseEnv", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "parseEnv is pure. Zod issues map to missing when the value is undefined, otherwise invalid, so raw Zod text never reaches output. Required variables are NODE_ENV, PORT, and a postgres DATABASE_URL. A test asserts a sentinel secret never appears."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_test_split", "label": "DB-less Test Split", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "pnpm test is unit plus Supertest with no database. test:db runs tagged tests against compose Postgres. test:e2e only lists Playwright specs in this ticket. Health is mounted before future auth middleware and is excluded from later rate limiting by position."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_prisma_no_models", "label": "Prisma With No Models", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The datasource is postgresql via DATABASE_URL. db-check runs SELECT 1 and prints no credentials. No models and no migrations means there is nothing to roll back. Starting compose and running db-check needs approval at task 4.2."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_checkpoints", "label": "Ordered Quality Checkpoints", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Stop at the first failure: workspace install and lint, shared lint test build, API lint test build, prisma validate and an approved test:db, web lint test build and an e2e list, then root lint, test, and build with git status showing no .env."}], "edges": [{"source": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_technical_plan", "target": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_proposal_proposal", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_technical_plan", "target": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_design_design", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_technical_plan", "target": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_tasks_tasks", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_technical_plan", "target": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_specs_service_health_spec_delta", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "openspec/changes/ab-1001-project-setup/plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_plan_technical_plan", "target": "openspec_changes_ab_1001_project_setup_specs_runtime_configuration_spec_delta", "relation":